{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-32377","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35618","text":"ADR-0005: Deployment Immutability + Active Deployment Pointer Model"}]},{"id":"blk-32378","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32380","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35619","marks":["bold"],"text":"Status:"},{"id":"spn-35620","text":" Accepted (v1)"}]}],"id":"blk-32379","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32382","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35621","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-35622","text":" 2026-01-21"}]}],"id":"blk-32381","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32384","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35623","marks":["bold"],"text":"Owners:"},{"id":"spn-35624","text":" webhost.systems engineering"}]}],"id":"blk-32383","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32386","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35625","marks":["bold"],"text":"Related docs:"}]}],"id":"blk-32385","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32388","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35626","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/00_MASTER_SPEC.md"}]}],"id":"blk-32387","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32390","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35627","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/10_API_CONTRACTS.md"}]}],"id":"blk-32389","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32392","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35628","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/20_RUNTIME_PROVIDER_INTERFACE.md"}]}],"id":"blk-32391","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32394","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35629","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/30_DATA_MODEL_CONVEX.md"}]}],"id":"blk-32393","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32396","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35630","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/60_TESTING_ACCEPTANCE.md"}]}],"id":"blk-32395","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32397","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35631","text":"1) Context"}]},{"id":"blk-32398","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35632","text":"webhost.systems deploys untrusted customer agent code to one of multiple runtime providers and routes invocations to the correct deployed version. The platform must support:"}]},{"id":"blk-32399","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32401","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35633","text":"safe, repeatable deployments,"}]}],"id":"blk-32400","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32403","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35634","text":"rapid iteration with reliable rollbacks,"}]}],"id":"blk-32402","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32405","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35635","text":"clear auditability (“what is running now, and who changed it?”),"}]}],"id":"blk-32404","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32407","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35636","text":"consistent routing across multiple runtime providers,"}]}],"id":"blk-32406","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32409","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35637","text":"robust handling of partial failures (deploy succeeded on provider but DB update failed; or vice versa),"}]}],"id":"blk-32408","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32411","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35638","text":"deterministic metering attribution to "},{"id":"spn-35639","marks":["code"],"text":"{userId, agentId, deploymentId, runtimeProvider}"},{"id":"spn-35640","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-32410","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32412","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35641","text":"Early prototypes often store deployment state “in place” on the agent record (e.g., overwriting "},{"id":"spn-35642","marks":["code"],"text":"workerUrl"},{"id":"spn-35643","text":", updating "},{"id":"spn-35644","marks":["code"],"text":"codeHash"},{"id":"spn-35645","text":", etc.). This tends to create correctness and support problems:"}]},{"id":"blk-32413","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32415","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35646","text":"You lose historical context (“what changed?”)."}]}],"id":"blk-32414","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32417","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35647","text":"Rollback is difficult or impossible without redeploying."}]}],"id":"blk-32416","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32419","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35648","text":"In-flight deploys can corrupt the “current” state if they fail midway."}]}],"id":"blk-32418","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32421","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35649","text":"Auditing, debugging, and cost reconciliation become fragile."}]}],"id":"blk-32420","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32423","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35650","text":"Concurrency introduces race conditions: two deploys can interleave and leave the agent in an inconsistent state."}]}],"id":"blk-32422","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32424","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35651","text":"Therefore, the system needs a durable, auditable, and concurrency-tolerant model for deployments and routing."}]},{"id":"blk-32425","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35652","text":"2) Decision"}]},{"id":"blk-32426","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35653","text":"2.1 Deployment immutability"}]},{"id":"blk-32427","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35654","text":"A "},{"id":"spn-35655","marks":["bold"],"text":"Deployment"},{"id":"spn-35656","text":" is an immutable record representing a specific released version of an agent."}]},{"id":"blk-32428","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32430","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35657","text":"A new deployment attempt MUST create a "},{"id":"spn-35658","marks":["bold"],"text":"new deployment record"},{"id":"spn-35659","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-35660","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments"},{"id":"spn-35661","text":" table row)."}]}],"id":"blk-32429","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32432","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35662","text":"Deployment records MUST be treated as immutable after creation, except for a narrowly defined mutable subset:"}]}],"id":"blk-32431","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32434","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35663","marks":["code"],"text":"status"},{"id":"spn-35664","text":" (e.g., deploying → active/failed)"}]}],"id":"blk-32433","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32436","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35665","marks":["code"],"text":"providerRef"},{"id":"spn-35666","text":" (filled once known)"}]}],"id":"blk-32435","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32438","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35667","marks":["code"],"text":"errorMessage"},{"id":"spn-35668","text":" (sanitized)"}]}],"id":"blk-32437","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32440","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35669","text":"timestamps like "},{"id":"spn-35670","marks":["code"],"text":"deployedAtMs"},{"id":"spn-35671","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-35672","marks":["code"],"text":"finishedAtMs"}]}],"id":"blk-32439","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32442","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35673","text":"optional "},{"id":"spn-35674","marks":["code"],"text":"logsRef"},{"id":"spn-35675","text":" pointer"}]}],"id":"blk-32441","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32444","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35676","text":"Any new code/artifact/provider configuration change MUST create a new deployment record (never modify an existing deployment to “become” the new version)."}]}],"id":"blk-32443","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32445","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35677","text":"2.2 Active deployment pointer"}]},{"id":"blk-32446","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35678","text":"Each agent has a single routing pointer:"}]},{"id":"blk-32447","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32449","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35679","marks":["code"],"text":"agents.activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35680","text":" points to the deployment that should receive invocations."}]}],"id":"blk-32448","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32451","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35681","text":"Rollback (and “activate old deployment”) is implemented by updating "},{"id":"spn-35682","marks":["code"],"text":"agents.activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35683","text":" to a previous deployment id."}]}],"id":"blk-32450","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32453","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35684","text":"Invocation routing uses ONLY:"}]}],"id":"blk-32452","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32455","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35685","text":"agent ownership checks + status checks, then"}]}],"id":"blk-32454","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32457","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35686","marks":["code"],"text":"activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35687","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-35688","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments.providerRef"},{"id":"spn-35689","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-35690","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments.runtimeProvider"},{"id":"spn-35691","text":" to select runtime adapter and invoke."}]}],"id":"blk-32456","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32458","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35692","text":"2.3 Single-writer rule per agent during deploy (v1 simplification)"}]},{"id":"blk-32459","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35693","text":"To reduce complexity and prevent version races in v1:"}]},{"id":"blk-32460","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32462","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35694","text":"The platform MUST prevent concurrent deployments per agent (e.g., guard with "},{"id":"spn-35695","marks":["code"],"text":"agents.status=deploying"},{"id":"spn-35696","text":" or a server-side mutex mechanism)."}]}],"id":"blk-32461","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32464","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35697","text":"A second deploy attempt while "},{"id":"spn-35698","marks":["code"],"text":"deploying"},{"id":"spn-35699","text":" SHOULD fail with "},{"id":"spn-35700","marks":["code"],"text":"CONFLICT"},{"id":"spn-35701","text":" (or be queued post-v1)."}]}],"id":"blk-32463","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32465","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35702","text":"3) Rationale"}]},{"id":"blk-32466","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35703","text":"3.1 Safety and correctness"}]},{"id":"blk-32467","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35704","text":"Immutability avoids a class of “torn writes” where partial updates leave the system in an inconsistent state. If deployment artifacts and references are immutable, you can always answer:"}]},{"id":"blk-32468","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32470","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35705","text":"exactly what was deployed,"}]}],"id":"blk-32469","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32472","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35706","text":"where it was deployed,"}]}],"id":"blk-32471","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32474","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35707","text":"and when it changed."}]}],"id":"blk-32473","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32475","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35708","text":"3.2 Rollbacks become fast and reliable"}]},{"id":"blk-32476","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35709","text":"With immutable deployments, rollback is primarily a pointer change:"}]},{"id":"blk-32477","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32479","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35710","text":"no redeploy required (unless provider forces it for technical reasons),"}]}],"id":"blk-32478","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32481","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35711","text":"quick recovery from bad deploys,"}]}],"id":"blk-32480","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32483","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35712","text":"repeatable and auditable."}]}],"id":"blk-32482","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32484","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35713","text":"3.3 Auditing and supportability"}]},{"id":"blk-32485","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35714","text":"A permanent deployment history supports:"}]},{"id":"blk-32486","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32488","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35715","text":"customer support (“what changed?”),"}]}],"id":"blk-32487","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32490","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35716","text":"incident response (“who activated what?”),"}]}],"id":"blk-32489","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32492","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35717","text":"compliance-aligned audits."}]}],"id":"blk-32491","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32493","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35718","text":"3.4 Metering attribution and future cost reconciliation"}]},{"id":"blk-32494","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35719","text":"When telemetry references a "},{"id":"spn-35720","marks":["code"],"text":"deploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35721","text":" and deployments are immutable, usage can always be attributed to an exact version and provider resource set. This also enables future provider cost reconciliation by tagging provider resources per deployment."}]},{"id":"blk-32495","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35722","text":"3.5 Multi-runtime routing simplicity"}]},{"id":"blk-32496","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35723","text":"A single "},{"id":"spn-35724","marks":["code"],"text":"activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35725","text":" model works uniformly across providers:"}]},{"id":"blk-32497","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32499","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35726","text":"Cloudflare: "},{"id":"spn-35727","marks":["code"],"text":"providerRef.cloudflare.workerUrl"},{"id":"spn-35728","text":" etc."}]}],"id":"blk-32498","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32501","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35729","text":"AgentCore: "},{"id":"spn-35730","marks":["code"],"text":"providerRef.agentcore.agentRuntimeArn"},{"id":"spn-35731","text":" etc."}]}],"id":"blk-32500","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32502","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35732","text":"The control plane remains provider-agnostic; provider-specific details are confined to adapter implementations."}]},{"id":"blk-32503","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35733","text":"4) Alternatives considered"}]},{"id":"blk-32504","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35734","text":"A) Mutable deployment state stored on the agent row only"}]},{"id":"blk-32505","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35735","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pros"}]},{"id":"blk-32506","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32508","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35736","text":"Minimal schema."}]}],"id":"blk-32507","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32510","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35737","text":"Simplifies “what’s currently active” (single record)."}]}],"id":"blk-32509","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32511","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35738","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cons"}]},{"id":"blk-32512","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32514","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35739","text":"Loses history."}]}],"id":"blk-32513","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32516","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35740","text":"Hard to rollback."}]}],"id":"blk-32515","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32518","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35741","text":"Partial failures can corrupt the running pointer."}]}],"id":"blk-32517","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32520","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35742","text":"Difficult to audit and debug."}]}],"id":"blk-32519","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32522","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35743","text":"Makes telemetry attribution ambiguous when “current deployment” changes."}]}],"id":"blk-32521","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32523","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35744","marks":["bold"],"text":"Decision:"},{"id":"spn-35745","text":" Rejected."}]},{"id":"blk-32524","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35746","text":"B) Immutable deployments without an active pointer (derive “active” from latest successful deploy)"}]},{"id":"blk-32525","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35747","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pros"}]},{"id":"blk-32526","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32528","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35748","text":"No pointer updates; “active” is last successful deployment."}]}],"id":"blk-32527","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32529","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35749","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cons"}]},{"id":"blk-32530","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32532","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35750","text":"Rollback becomes non-trivial (must “fake” a new deploy or add flags)."}]}],"id":"blk-32531","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32534","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35751","text":"“Latest” is not always what you want running (e.g., canary, manual pinning)."}]}],"id":"blk-32533","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32536","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35752","text":"In-flight deploys complicate “latest success” semantics."}]}],"id":"blk-32535","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32537","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35753","marks":["bold"],"text":"Decision:"},{"id":"spn-35754","text":" Rejected."}]},{"id":"blk-32538","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35755","text":"C) Mutable “active deployment” record plus separate immutable history"}]},{"id":"blk-32539","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35756","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pros"}]},{"id":"blk-32540","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32542","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35757","text":"A dedicated active record could simplify reads."}]}],"id":"blk-32541","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32543","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35758","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cons"}]},{"id":"blk-32544","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32546","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35759","text":"You now have two sources of truth to keep consistent."}]}],"id":"blk-32545","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32548","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35760","text":"Reintroduces mutability issues for the “active” record."}]}],"id":"blk-32547","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32550","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35761","text":"Added complexity with limited benefit over a pointer."}]}],"id":"blk-32549","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32551","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35762","marks":["bold"],"text":"Decision:"},{"id":"spn-35763","text":" Rejected."}]},{"id":"blk-32552","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35764","text":"D) Blue/green or canary routing model as default"}]},{"id":"blk-32553","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35765","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pros"}]},{"id":"blk-32554","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32556","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35766","text":"Advanced rollout safety."}]}],"id":"blk-32555","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32557","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35767","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cons"}]},{"id":"blk-32558","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32560","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35768","text":"Too complex for v1."}]}],"id":"blk-32559","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32562","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35769","text":"Requires traffic splitting, per-request routing policies, and richer metrics gating."}]}],"id":"blk-32561","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32564","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35770","text":"Still requires immutable deployments underneath."}]}],"id":"blk-32563","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32565","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35771","marks":["bold"],"text":"Decision:"},{"id":"spn-35772","text":" Deferred to post-v1; can be built on top of this ADR."}]},{"id":"blk-32566","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35773","text":"5) Consequences"}]},{"id":"blk-32567","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35774","text":"5.1 Positive consequences"}]},{"id":"blk-32568","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32570","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35775","text":"Reliable rollback (pointer flip)."}]}],"id":"blk-32569","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32572","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35776","text":"Clear deployment audit trail."}]}],"id":"blk-32571","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32574","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35777","text":"Strong basis for incident response and debugging."}]}],"id":"blk-32573","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32576","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35778","text":"Simplified multi-runtime invocation routing."}]}],"id":"blk-32575","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32578","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35779","text":"Enables deterministic telemetry attribution and later cost reconciliation."}]}],"id":"blk-32577","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32579","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35780","text":"5.2 Negative consequences / tradeoffs"}]},{"id":"blk-32580","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32582","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35781","text":"More schema and records (deployments grow over time)."}]}],"id":"blk-32581","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32584","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35782","text":"Requires retention policy decisions for old deployments (storage cleanup, provider resource deprovisioning)."}]}],"id":"blk-32583","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32586","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35783","text":"Requires careful handling of “deploy succeeded but DB update failed” and vice versa."}]}],"id":"blk-32585","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32588","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35784","text":"Requires a versioning strategy (monotonic per agent) and concurrency controls."}]}],"id":"blk-32587","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32589","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35785","text":"6) Implementation details (normative requirements)"}]},{"id":"blk-32590","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35786","text":"6.1 Data model requirements"}]},{"id":"blk-32591","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35787","text":"The following fields/semantics MUST exist (names may vary if consistent):"}]},{"id":"blk-32592","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32594","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35788","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments"},{"id":"spn-35789","text":" table with:"}]}],"id":"blk-32593","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32596","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35790","marks":["code"],"text":"agentId"},{"id":"spn-35791","text":", "},{"id":"spn-35792","marks":["code"],"text":"userId"}]}],"id":"blk-32595","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32598","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35793","marks":["code"],"text":"version"},{"id":"spn-35794","text":" (monotonic per agent)"}]}],"id":"blk-32597","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32600","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35795","marks":["code"],"text":"runtimeProvider"}]}],"id":"blk-32599","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32602","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35796","marks":["code"],"text":"artifact"},{"id":"spn-35797","text":" reference (uploaded bundle or repo ref)"}]}],"id":"blk-32601","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32604","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35798","marks":["code"],"text":"providerRef"},{"id":"spn-35799","text":" (runtime-specific invoke reference)"}]}],"id":"blk-32603","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32606","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35800","marks":["code"],"text":"status"},{"id":"spn-35801","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-35802","marks":["code"],"text":"errorMessage"}]}],"id":"blk-32605","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32608","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35803","text":"timestamps ("},{"id":"spn-35804","marks":["code"],"text":"createdAtMs"},{"id":"spn-35805","text":", "},{"id":"spn-35806","marks":["code"],"text":"deployedAtMs"},{"id":"spn-35807","text":", "},{"id":"spn-35808","marks":["code"],"text":"finishedAtMs"},{"id":"spn-35809","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-32607","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32610","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35810","marks":["code"],"text":"agents.activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35811","text":" pointer to "},{"id":"spn-35812","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments._id"},{"id":"spn-35813","text":" (nullable)"}]}],"id":"blk-32609","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32611","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35814","text":"6.2 Immutability enforcement"}]},{"id":"blk-32612","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32614","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35815","text":"Server code MUST NOT update artifact identity fields on "},{"id":"spn-35816","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments"},{"id":"spn-35817","text":" after creation:"}]}],"id":"blk-32613","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32616","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35818","marks":["code"],"text":"artifact.*"},{"id":"spn-35819","text":", "},{"id":"spn-35820","marks":["code"],"text":"manifest.*"},{"id":"spn-35821","text":", "},{"id":"spn-35822","marks":["code"],"text":"runtimeProvider"},{"id":"spn-35823","text":", "},{"id":"spn-35824","marks":["code"],"text":"version"}]}],"id":"blk-32615","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32618","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35825","text":"Only the allowed mutable subset may be updated (status/providerRef/error/timestamps/log pointers)."}]}],"id":"blk-32617","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32620","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35826","text":"Client code MUST NOT be allowed to update deployment rows directly."}]}],"id":"blk-32619","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32621","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35827","text":"6.3 Activation rules"}]},{"id":"blk-32622","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35828","text":"When activating a deployment (including rollback):"}]},{"id":"blk-32623","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32625","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35829","text":"The target deployment MUST:"}]}],"id":"blk-32624","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32627","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35830","text":"belong to the agent,"}]}],"id":"blk-32626","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32629","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35831","text":"belong to the current user (tenant check),"}]}],"id":"blk-32628","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32631","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35832","text":"be in a valid state for activation (recommended: "},{"id":"spn-35833","marks":["code"],"text":"status=active"},{"id":"spn-35834","text":")."}]}],"id":"blk-32630","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32633","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35835","text":"The system MUST update "},{"id":"spn-35836","marks":["code"],"text":"agents.activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35837","text":" to the target deployment id."}]}],"id":"blk-32632","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32635","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35838","text":"The system SHOULD record an audit log entry:"}]}],"id":"blk-32634","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32637","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35839","marks":["code"],"text":"deployment.activate"},{"id":"spn-35840","text":" with "},{"id":"spn-35841","marks":["code"],"text":"{agentId, deploymentId}"},{"id":"spn-35842","text":" and optional reason."}]}],"id":"blk-32636","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32638","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35843","text":"6.4 Routing rules"}]},{"id":"blk-32639","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35844","text":"The invocation gateway MUST route using: 1. resolve agent and enforce ownership (unless public agents exist post-v1), 2. verify agent is not "},{"id":"spn-35845","marks":["code"],"text":"disabled"},{"id":"spn-35846","text":"/deleted, 3. read "},{"id":"spn-35847","marks":["code"],"text":"activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35848","text":", 4. load deployment by id and verify it belongs to agent and user, 5. route via runtime adapter selected by "},{"id":"spn-35849","marks":["code"],"text":"deployment.runtimeProvider"},{"id":"spn-35850","text":", 6. invoke using "},{"id":"spn-35851","marks":["code"],"text":"deployment.providerRef"},{"id":"spn-35852","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-32640","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35853","text":"Routing MUST NOT use “latest deployment” heuristics."}]},{"id":"blk-32641","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35854","text":"6.5 Deploy flow atomicity and failure handling"}]},{"id":"blk-32642","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35855","text":"A deployment flow typically spans multiple systems (DB + provider). The platform MUST handle partial failures."}]},{"id":"blk-32643","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35856","text":"Minimum v1 requirement:"}]},{"id":"blk-32644","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32646","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35857","text":"The system MUST persist a deployment row with "},{"id":"spn-35858","marks":["code"],"text":"status=deploying"},{"id":"spn-35859","text":" before making provider calls."}]}],"id":"blk-32645","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32648","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35860","text":"If provider deployment fails:"}]}],"id":"blk-32647","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32650","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35861","text":"set deployment "},{"id":"spn-35862","marks":["code"],"text":"status=failed"},{"id":"spn-35863","text":" and store sanitized "},{"id":"spn-35864","marks":["code"],"text":"errorMessage"},{"id":"spn-35865","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-32649","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32652","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35866","text":"set agent "},{"id":"spn-35867","marks":["code"],"text":"status=error"},{"id":"spn-35868","text":" (or keep existing status but expose failure)."}]}],"id":"blk-32651","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32654","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35869","text":"If provider deployment succeeds but DB update fails:"}]}],"id":"blk-32653","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32656","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35870","text":"the system MUST have a retry mechanism (manual or automated) to reconcile:"}]}],"id":"blk-32655","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32658","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35871","text":"either re-run the “finalize deploy” step idempotently, or"}]}],"id":"blk-32657","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32660","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35872","text":"detect orphaned provider resources via tags and mark deployment active later."}]}],"id":"blk-32659","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32662","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35873","text":"If DB update succeeds but provider deployment later fails (rare but possible due to eventual consistency):"}]}],"id":"blk-32661","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32664","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35874","text":"system must reconcile on next healthcheck/invoke attempt and mark deployment failed if unusable."}]}],"id":"blk-32663","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32665","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35875","text":"6.6 Provider resource tagging (required for cleanup and reconciliation)"}]},{"id":"blk-32666","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35876","text":"All provider resources created for a deployment MUST be tagged/labelled with:"}]},{"id":"blk-32667","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32669","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35877","marks":["code"],"text":"userId"}]}],"id":"blk-32668","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32671","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35878","marks":["code"],"text":"agentId"}]}],"id":"blk-32670","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32673","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35879","marks":["code"],"text":"deploymentId"}]}],"id":"blk-32672","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32675","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35880","marks":["code"],"text":"deploymentVersion"}]}],"id":"blk-32674","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32677","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35881","marks":["code"],"text":"runtimeProvider"}]}],"id":"blk-32676","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32678","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35882","text":"6.7 Retention and cleanup"}]},{"id":"blk-32679","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32681","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35883","text":"Deployments are retained as part of audit history."}]}],"id":"blk-32680","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32683","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35884","text":"The platform SHOULD implement:"}]}],"id":"blk-32682","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32685","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35885","text":"retention policy for old deployments (e.g., keep last N or last X days) per tier,"}]}],"id":"blk-32684","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32687","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35886","text":"best-effort deprovisioning of provider resources when deployments are deleted or when an agent is deleted."}]}],"id":"blk-32686","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32689","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35887","text":"Cleanup MUST be careful not to remove resources for the currently active deployment."}]}],"id":"blk-32688","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32690","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35888","text":"7) Testing requirements (acceptance-focused)"}]},{"id":"blk-32691","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35889","text":"7.1 Unit tests (MUST)"}]},{"id":"blk-32692","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32694","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35890","text":"Deployment status transition validation."}]}],"id":"blk-32693","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32696","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35891","text":"Immutability enforcement (attempted mutation of immutable fields rejected)."}]}],"id":"blk-32695","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32698","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35892","text":"Activation validation (wrong agent/user/state rejected)."}]}],"id":"blk-32697","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32700","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35893","text":"Routing resolver uses "},{"id":"spn-35894","marks":["code"],"text":"activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35895","text":" only."}]}],"id":"blk-32699","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32701","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35896","text":"7.2 Integration tests (MUST)"}]},{"id":"blk-32702","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32704","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35897","text":"Deploy creates new immutable record; a second deploy creates a second record."}]}],"id":"blk-32703","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32706","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35898","text":"Activate (rollback) changes routing immediately."}]}],"id":"blk-32705","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32708","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35899","text":"Concurrent deploy attempts are rejected with "},{"id":"spn-35900","marks":["code"],"text":"CONFLICT"},{"id":"spn-35901","text":" (v1)."}]}],"id":"blk-32707","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32710","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35902","text":"Telemetry attribution includes correct "},{"id":"spn-35903","marks":["code"],"text":"deploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35904","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-32709","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32711","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35905","text":"7.3 E2E tests (MUST)"}]},{"id":"blk-32712","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32714","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35906","text":"Deploy v1 → invoke returns v1 output."}]}],"id":"blk-32713","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32716","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35907","text":"Deploy v2 → invoke returns v2 output."}]}],"id":"blk-32715","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32718","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35908","text":"Activate v1 → invoke returns v1 output again."}]}],"id":"blk-32717","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32720","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35909","text":"Deployment history remains intact and visible."}]}],"id":"blk-32719","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32721","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35910","text":"8) Future extensions enabled by this ADR"}]},{"id":"blk-32722","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35911","text":"This model is a foundation for:"}]},{"id":"blk-32723","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32725","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35912","text":"canary/blue-green deployments (multiple “active” pointers with traffic split policies),"}]}],"id":"blk-32724","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32727","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35913","text":"environment promotion (dev → staging → prod) with deployment immutability preserved,"}]}],"id":"blk-32726","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32729","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35914","text":"signed deployment manifests / provenance,"}]}],"id":"blk-32728","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32731","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35915","text":"provider billing reconciliation (resource tags + immutable providerRef),"}]}],"id":"blk-32730","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32733","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35916","text":"more advanced rollback policies (automatic rollback on error rate thresholds)."}]}],"id":"blk-32732","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32734","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-35917","text":"9) Acceptance criteria"}]},{"id":"blk-32735","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-35918","text":"This ADR is correctly implemented when: 1. Every deployment attempt creates a new deployment record and does not mutate previous deployments’ immutable fields. 2. An agent’s invocations always route to "},{"id":"spn-35919","marks":["code"],"text":"activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-35920","text":" (no “latest deploy” routing). 3. Rollback is implemented as an activation/pointer update and takes effect immediately for new invocations. 4. Deployment status transitions are correct and failures do not corrupt the active deployment pointer. 5. Provider resources are tagged with "},{"id":"spn-35921","marks":["code"],"text":"{userId, agentId, deploymentId}"},{"id":"spn-35922","text":". 6. E2E tests demonstrate deploy v1 → deploy v2 → rollback to v1 with correct outputs and preserved history."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaiera5y6wnm24aaz767a2hku62n7wvbxbbsacz6wdutegwzjv3rno7msq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}